  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.14.0: AW007 (no-interface info diagnostic), [HttpClient] attribute (typed/named HTTP client registration), Roslyn code fix providers (AW001, AW003, AW006). 1.13.0: AW006 (Transient IDisposable warning), [Options] attribute for config binding, enum-keyed services (type-safe Key property), multi-assembly scanning (AssemblyOf on [AutoWireScan]). 1.12.0: Condition property (compile-time #if gating) and IncludeLazy property (auto-register Lazy<T>) on all registration attributes. 1.11.0: [Factory] attribute + AW005 + benchmarks. 1.10.1: Fix NuGet packaging. 1.10.0: Convention scanning. 1.9.0: Profile. 1.8.0: Ordered decorators. 1.7.0: AW004. 1.6.0: IncludeSelf. 1.5.0: [HostedService]. 1.4.0: Decorators. 1.3.0: DuplicateStrategy/TryX. 1.2.0: Open generics. 1.0.0: Initial.",
